hair-transplant-after.jpg","beforeThumb":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-before-768x768.jpg","afterThumb":"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/hair-transplant-after-768x768.jpg","beforeAlt":"Before: Hair Transplant Surgery","afterAlt":"After: Hair Transplant Surgery","imagePairs":[],"ageGroup":"31-45","procedureType":"Surgical","description":"<h2><strong>Hair Transplant Surgery<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Hair transplant surgery is a permanent hair restoration solution that involves relocating hair follicles from areas with dense growth to thinning or balding regions. The procedure can be done using advanced techniques like FUE or FUT, both of which deliver natural-looking, long-lasting results. It\u2019s a popular choice for individuals seeking to restore hairline, fill in bald patches, or add volume to thinning hair. Over time, the transplanted hair grows just like natural hair, blending seamlessly with existing strands.<\/p>\n","content":"<h2><strong>Hair Transplant Surgery<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>Hair transplant surgery is a permanent hair restoration solution that involves relocating hair follicles from areas with dense growth to thinning or balding regions. The procedure can be done using advanced techniques like FUE or FUT, both of which deliver natural-looking, long-lasting results. It\u2019s a popular choice for individuals seeking to restore hairline, fill in bald patches, or add volume to thinning hair. Over time, the transplanted hair grows just like natural hair, blending seamlessly with existing strands.<\/p>\n","procedureInfo":"<p><strong>What it does:<\/strong><br \/>Hair transplant surgery restores hair in thinning or balding areas by moving healthy hair follicles from a donor site (usually the back or sides of the scalp) to areas with hair loss. The two main techniques are FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction) and FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation). It\u2019s ideal for treating male or female pattern baldness.<\/p>\n<p><strong>How long it lasts:<\